{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":249,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Experience"},"children":["Experience"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwCQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Experience"]},", normally shortened to ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Exp"]},", is a form of non-spendable currency that is always rewarded at the end of matches. You can also earn ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Experience"]}," through other methods, like ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Codes","title":"Codes"},"children":["codes"]},". While it cannot be spent, it is used in the Level Bar while in the lobby to level up to higher levels. Each time you ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Levels","title":"Levels"},"children":["level"]}," up, the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Exp"]}," in your experience bar resets."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Levels","title":"Levels"},"children":["Levels"]}," are used to unlock some towers (like the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Crook_Boss","title":"Crook Boss"},"children":["Crook Boss"]},"), give you the ability to buy some towers such as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Accelerator","title":"Accelerator"},"children":["Accelerator"]}," or unlock certain parts of gameplay (like ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Fallen_Mode","title":"Fallen Mode"},"children":["Fallen"]}," mode and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Hardcore_Mode","title":"Hardcore Mode"},"children":["Hardcore"]}," mode)."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The amount of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Experience"]}," earned at the end of a match is multiplied by 1.25x with the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Gamepasses","title":"Gamepasses"},"children":["VIP gamepass"]},". During periods of 50% more ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Experience"]}," (00:00 UTC Friday – 00:00 UTC Sunday), any ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Experience"]}," earned is multiplied by 1.5x. Special maps, like ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Pizza_Party","title":"Pizza Party"},"children":["Pizza Party"]}," or ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Winter_Stronghold","title":"Winter Stronghold"},"children":["Winter Stronghold"]},", have modifiers which increase the amount of ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Exp"]}," you get. For example, in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Mason_Arch","title":"Mason Arch"},"children":["Mason Arch"]},", when ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Molten_Mode","title":"Molten Mode"},"children":["Molten"]}," mode is chosen, you receive ",{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwIQ"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Experience"]}]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[" "]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwIg"},"children":["203 EXP"]}," when triumphing instead of ",{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwIw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Experience"]}]},{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[" "]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwJA"},"children":["185 EXP"]},", as the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/All_Paths","title":"All Paths"},"children":["All Paths"]}," modifier increases currency rewards by 10%."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["It takes the appearance of a blue star."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwJw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Update_History"},"children":["Update History"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["14 June 2